<title>USA: Phillips Petroleum may issue debt this week.</title>
<headline>Phillips Petroleum may issue debt this week.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Phillips Petroleum Co is rumored to be bringing a debt offering to market as early as this week, high-grade syndicate sources said on Monday.</p>
<p>&quot;Phillips Petroleum is rumored to bring a deal,&quot; said one syndicate source.</p>
<p>No further details were available on the offering.</p>
<p>--Nancy Leinfuss, 212-859-1675</p>
</text>
